     "what": "Commercial Davis Minimal Broth formula (paper cites only 'Sigma' with no literature reference)",
     "obtained": true,
     "how": "WebSearch of Sigma-Aldrich 93753 / Davis Minimal Agar 79332 datasheets, BD 275610, and HiMedia M389 datasheet (Sigma/HiMedia PDFs timed out; formula recovered verbatim from datasheet text via search)",
     "added": [
      "K2HPO4 7 g/L",
